{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>本港周四（12日）早上市區最低氣溫約22°C，新界再低兩三度。日間部分時間有陽光及乾燥，最高氣溫約27°C。吹和緩東至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁。周五（13日）稍後至周六（14日）初時有驟雨，周六稍後及下周日（15日）短暫時間有陽光。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T13:59:07.330313+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:18:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:34:54.194534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:52:37.284468+00:00","content_hash":"968717b6f3559ccfc9a1f665d620630ce7a88f67e9fdd45404d442814f3a9841","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}